## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gargoyle
## Notes: Your guild's raids and signups in game (with a heads-up about new raids and a reminder before raids you haven't signed up for), and your characters kept up to date on your Gargoyle account. Open it with the minimap button or /gargoyle. Each feature can be turned on or off in Options > AddOns > Gargoyle.
